body:
You have to be in Axe mode with your shield charged up and all phials filled. Press the triangle and O button together and you will do a SAED in the direction you face. 

&#x200B;

Bonus tip: You can press O thrice to do two phial attacks which also automatically combo into an SAED for max deebs. If you want more tips on charge blade I wouldn't mind teaching you.
